{"path":"numeric/random/philox_engine/philox_engine","title":"std::philox_engine<UIntType,w,n,r,consts>::philox_engine","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::philox_engine&lt;UIntType,w,n,r,consts&gt;::</span>philox_engine","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/philox_engine","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs the pseudo-random number engine.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">philox_engine<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> philox_engine<span class=\"br0\">(</span>default_seed<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> philox_engine<span class=\"br0\">(</span> result_type value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> SeedSeq <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> philox_engine<span class=\"br0\">(</span> SeedSeq<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> seq <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">philox_engine<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> philox_engine<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs the pseudo-random number engine.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The default constructor.\n<ul><li> If the default-constructed engine is of type <code>std::philox4x32</code>, the 10000th consecutive invocation of it produces the value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1955073260</span></span></code>.\n</li><li> If the default-constructed engine is of type <code>std::philox4x64</code>, the 10000th consecutive invocation of it produces the value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">3409172418970261260</span></span></code>.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Constructs the engine with a seed value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>. The engine's initial <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine#Generator_properties\">state</a> is determined as follows:<sup id=\"cite_ref-y_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-y-1\">[1]</a></sup>\n<ul><li> All elements of the sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">X</span></code> are set to zero.\n</li><li> The first element of the sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">K</span></code> is set to <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize value \\mod 2^w\">value mod 2<span class=\"t-su\">w<br></span></span>, the remaining elements are set to zero.\n</li><li> The value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">j</span></code> is set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Constructs the engine with a seed sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">seq</span></code>. The engine's initial <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine#Generator_properties\">state</a> is determined as follows:<sup id=\"cite_ref-y_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-y-1\">[1]</a></sup>\n<ul><li> All elements of the sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">X</span></code> are set to zero.\n</li><li> Given <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>w <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">32</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>, the elements of the sequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">K</span></code> are set by the following steps:\n</li></ul>\n<ol><li> Creates an invented array object <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">a</span></code> of length <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p</span></code>.\n</li><li> Calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">seq.<span class=\"me1\">generate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, a <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> n <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> p<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</li><li> For each integer <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">k</span></code> in <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span></span></code><code>)</code></span>, sets <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize K_k\">K<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">k</span></span> to <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize (\\sum^{p-1}_{i=0} a_{k \\cdot p+i} \\cdot 2^{32i}) \\mod 2^w\">(∑<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">p-1<br>i=0</span> a<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">k·p+i</span>·2<span class=\"t-su\">32i<br></span>) mod 2<span class=\"t-su\">w<br></span></span>.\n</li></ol>\n<ul><li> The value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">j</span></code> is set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code>SeedSeq</code> meets the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/SeedSequence\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">SeedSequence</em></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> The copy constructor. Upon construction, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-y-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-y_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-y_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The buffer <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Y</span></code> is intentionally not being set. As <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">j</span></code> is being set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>, the next state transition always generates new random values and stores them in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Y</span></code>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> seed value to use in the initialization of the internal state\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> seq\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> seed sequence to use in the initialization of the internal state\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Constant.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Same as the complexity of the <code>seq.generate</code> call.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Constant.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> If <code>SeedSeq</code> is not <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq\">std::seed_seq</a></span>, throws the exceptions thrown by the <code>seq.generate</code> call.</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/seed\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>seed</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the current state of the engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/set_counter\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>set_counter</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the current counter of the engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/philox_engine","title":"std::philox_engine"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::philox_engine<UIntType,w,n,r,consts>::philox_engine","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++26. Constructs the pseudo-random number engine."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value, seq"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If SeedSeq is not std::seed_seq, throws the exceptions thrown by the seq.generate call."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"seed","note":"sets the current state of the engine"},{"label":"set_counter","note":"sets the current counter of the engine"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":378,"codeBlockCount":0}
